WEBVTT

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.625
Here is today's schedule.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:45.458
Following breakfast,
from 9:00 until 11:00, will be liberal arts.

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:48.333
It will be mathematics and geography today.

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:51.542
From 11:00 until 12:00 will be royal economics.

00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:53.917
Following that will be a clothing change,

00:00:53.917 --> 00:00:57.042
and at 12:30, we will have a state dinner.

00:00:57.042 --> 00:01:01.125
From 15:00 until 17:00,
there will be royal karate training.

00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:02.875
Miss Anya?

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.875
Miss Anya Hepburn?

00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:17.708
Miss Anya, you look cute when you're sleeping.

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:22.042
I wasn't sleeping! I was just
thinking with my eyes closed.

00:01:22.042 --> 00:01:24.750
I heard everything you were saying.

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:29.125
Okay, everyone,
I will show you to the girls' dorms.

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:33.917
That sure is a pretty brooch, isn't it?

00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:35.333
Hmm?

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:38.000
Oh, it's my family crest.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.792
Your family crest?!

00:01:39.792 --> 00:01:44.417
Yes... It is our normal custom
to wear it, so I couldn't help it.

00:01:44.417 --> 00:01:48.208
Miss Anya, you mean, you're an
extremely high-class young lady?

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.667
I am not!

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:53.042
Miss Harudori, are you sure
you're not just too common?

00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:54.833
I truly am disappointed.

00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:57.000
Gagantous!

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:05.292
<i>we wanna be there even if we had to</i>
<i>twist the world all around to get there</i>

00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:16.167
<i>without you, i guess i couldn't</i>
<i>even find the future here today</i>

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:27.167
<i>i was always trying to take nothing for granted</i>

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:35.167
<i>for the day i might lose them</i>

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:42.208
<i>but you just came in to my black</i>
<i>and white monochrome destiny</i>

00:02:42.208 --> 00:02:52.375
<i>and colored it all over</i>

00:02:53.208 --> 00:02:59.750
<i>we won't be satisfied with the routine future</i>

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:07.208
<i>we were born to make a new history come true</i>

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:14.375
<i>there's absolutely no</i>
<i>absolute thing in this world</i>

00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:18.958
<i>this road goes on forever</i>

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:25.083
<i>as long as we won't give up</i>

00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:30.875
Um, ma'am?

00:03:30.875 --> 00:03:32.625
It's Eternal Feather.

00:03:32.625 --> 00:03:35.333
Oh. Do we have to walk far?

00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:39.417
Mm-mm. Once we pass through
the market ahead, we're almost there.

00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:44.042
Um, Miss Tsugumi, where are we headed again?

00:03:44.042 --> 00:03:47.875
Huh? The girls' dorm, where
we will be staying from now on.

00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:50.542
Oh, that's right. How forgetful of me.

00:03:50.542 --> 00:03:53.083
You're beyond forgetful.

00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:12.250
It's a fine town, isn't it?

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:17.250
Yes, I suppose. A woebegone town
just right for you, Miss Tsugumi.

00:04:17.292 --> 00:04:20.292
"Girls' Dorms à la Carte!"

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.000
See that you don't squander it.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.542
The allowance you just got from
the school has to last you a week.

00:04:27.542 --> 00:04:31.917
You have to use it to pay for
your meals and daily necessities.

00:04:31.917 --> 00:04:33.958
Even taking out for meals and whatnot,

00:04:33.958 --> 00:04:37.292
this is far more than the
allowance I got at home.

00:04:37.292 --> 00:04:39.917
You cannot get an advance on your allowance,

00:04:39.917 --> 00:04:42.917
so starting tomorrow,
if you don't have anything to eat,

00:04:42.917 --> 00:04:46.250
you'll have to get a job to earn
more money, so keep that in mind.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.917
A job? You mean part-time work?

00:04:49.917 --> 00:04:55.500
I'm still at a middle-school age,
so I've never had a job before.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.875
Me, neither.

00:04:56.875 --> 00:04:59.042
Huh? How old are you?

00:04:59.042 --> 00:05:00.250
I'm 14.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.542
Oh, we're the same!

00:05:02.542 --> 00:05:05.125
And yet... different.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.375
I'm 14, too.

00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:10.000
Oh, yeah?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.167
DWMA often has varied ages,
even in the same class.

00:05:14.167 --> 00:05:15.792
This is terrific, huh?

00:05:15.792 --> 00:05:17.167
Yes.

00:05:18.542 --> 00:05:21.833
Here. This is the DWMA's girls' dorm.

00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:23.625
Wow!

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:30.875
Amazing! Miss Meme, Miss Anya, isn't it nice?

00:05:30.875 --> 00:05:35.208
I was expecting a more modest,
guesthouse-like place.

00:05:39.375 --> 00:05:45.042
Before we go in the dorm, there's
something I'd like you to remember.

00:05:45.042 --> 00:05:47.292
Watch out for the girls' dorm witch.

00:05:47.292 --> 00:05:49.667
Huh? Witch?

00:05:55.333 --> 00:05:58.875
All right, welcome to the DWMA's girls' dorm!

00:06:01.083 --> 00:06:03.667
There's no way DWMA has a witch.

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:06.625
They'd get along like cats
and dogs with each other.

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:11.167
Pardon the intrusion...

00:06:17.792 --> 00:06:20.375
This is Kana Altair.

00:06:20.375 --> 00:06:22.292
She's good at telling fortunes.

00:06:22.292 --> 00:06:23.958
Hello.

00:06:26.667 --> 00:06:29.667
I will read your fortune for today.

00:06:35.917 --> 00:06:38.042
Here it is.

00:06:38.042 --> 00:06:40.375
Woe.

00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:41.958
Watch yourself, newbie.

00:06:41.958 --> 00:06:44.792
J-J-Just a bit more detail?

00:06:44.792 --> 00:06:50.375
There is no way a child can
divine anything using tarot cards.

00:06:50.375 --> 00:06:51.708
The Fool.

00:06:52.708 --> 00:06:53.542
The Pig.

00:06:53.542 --> 00:06:55.458
The tarot doesn't even have that card!

00:06:55.458 --> 00:06:57.083
Go home!

00:06:57.083 --> 00:07:00.000
What is with this girl?!
She may be small, but she's insolent!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.333
--Fool? Pig? Those aren't even--hey!
--Now, now, Miss Anya, let's go.

00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:05.208
Hold on! Wait! I'm not done talking!

00:07:08.417 --> 00:07:13.042
This floor is everyone's living space.

00:07:13.042 --> 00:07:17.583
Bathroom goods are provided,
but if you prefer a type of shampoo,

00:07:17.583 --> 00:07:20.083
please prepare that yourself.

00:07:20.083 --> 00:07:21.792
The kitchen is also a common area.

00:07:21.792 --> 00:07:24.583
Please feel free to use whatever is here.

00:07:24.583 --> 00:07:30.708
1884 Kukirita Arta furniture, with Meissen china.

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:33.417
They use some pretty fine things here, huh?

00:07:33.417 --> 00:07:34.917
That's no fun.

00:07:34.917 --> 00:07:37.458
--Miss Tsugumi?
--Yes?!

00:07:37.458 --> 00:07:39.917
Is something the matter?

00:07:39.917 --> 00:07:43.667
Oh, I was just wondering where the witch is--

00:07:47.083 --> 00:07:51.500
I'm sorry. Your hair is so perfect,
I couldn't help myself.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.750
This is the dorm's housemaster, Miss Misery.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.125
I'm always in the housemaster's
room on the first floor,

00:07:57.125 --> 00:07:59.792
so if anything comes up, feel free.

00:07:59.792 --> 00:08:02.792
I'm Meme Tatane. It's nice to meet you.

00:08:02.792 --> 00:08:05.083
The pleasure is all mine.

00:08:05.083 --> 00:08:08.333
I'm Tsugumi Harudori, and I'll be
placing myself in your good graces.

00:08:09.292 --> 00:08:11.167
Mary...

00:08:11.167 --> 00:08:14.708
Okay, it's time for me
to show you all to your room.

00:08:15.875 --> 00:08:17.792
Miss Tsugumi, we're going.

00:08:17.792 --> 00:08:19.542
R-Right.

00:08:23.125 --> 00:08:26.042
I've found you, Mary.

00:08:28.625 --> 00:08:31.125
This is your room.

00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:35.833
Wow. This is where we're going to live now?

00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:40.000
It looks like your things have arrived
as well, so make yourselves at home.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:44.708
Thank you for everything today, Endless Waltz.

00:08:44.708 --> 00:08:46.500
That's "Eternal Feather."

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.583
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:55.667
Ah, it's so soft! Is it okay if I take this one?

00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:58.833
Oh, then I'll take the neighboring--

00:08:58.833 --> 00:09:00.292
Ah! Miss Meme!

00:09:00.292 --> 00:09:03.583
Huh? Did you want this one?

00:09:03.583 --> 00:09:06.000
No, not really...

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:10.792
If you like that one, Miss Meme,
then anywhere is fine with me.

00:09:10.792 --> 00:09:15.167
Okay, that settles it. I've always wanted a bed!

00:09:15.167 --> 00:09:17.083
Have you slept in a futon up to now?

00:09:17.083 --> 00:09:19.417
Mm-hmm. I'm so wound up,
I may not be able to sleep.

00:09:19.417 --> 00:09:21.375
You'll be fine.

00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:22.542
Do you think so?

00:09:22.542 --> 00:09:24.208
You'll be fine.

00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:26.292
Do you think so?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.458
"Dear Mom, I've safely arrived in Death Vegas! ...even more
stimulating than I imagined ...but in the girls' dorm..."

00:09:48.375 --> 00:09:50.250
I'm turning off the lights, okay?

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.875
Yes. Good night.

00:09:52.875 --> 00:09:54.333
Good night.

00:10:04.083 --> 00:10:08.917
Lying down on the cold stone floor,
Mary thought to herself,

00:10:08.917 --> 00:10:13.458
"It was wrong for a commoner
like me to dream, wasn't it?"

00:10:13.458 --> 00:10:19.292
Right now, the warmth of Nyaro,
as she purred in her arms,

00:10:19.292 --> 00:10:23.500
was Mary's only possession.

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.750
Huh? Housemaster? Hmm?

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:27.958
Huh?

00:10:27.958 --> 00:10:31.333
You know it, right? "The Commoner of Flanders."

00:10:31.333 --> 00:10:37.042
And you are the exact image of the main
character, Mary Smith, the way I picture her.

00:10:37.042 --> 00:10:40.000
Wait, what are you saying?

00:10:41.292 --> 00:10:45.792
I will groom you to become the perfect Mary.

00:10:45.792 --> 00:10:49.083
You don't mean, Housemaster,
you're the witch of the dorm?!

00:10:49.083 --> 00:10:52.750
Your nose is perhaps a
bit too long to be Mary's.

00:10:55.125 --> 00:10:57.167
It will all be over soon.

00:10:58.583 --> 00:11:00.875
Ah! Miss Meme, help me!

00:11:02.333 --> 00:11:04.958
Huh? You're asleep?

00:11:05.167 --> 00:11:08.958
Be a good girl and go back to bed.

00:11:30.333 --> 00:11:33.917
She's still asleep? She's drunken boxing?!

00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:39.583
Huh? Miss Meme?

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.333
Mary doesn't need any friends.

00:11:47.333 --> 00:11:49.667
Miss Meme, the housemaster is coming!

00:11:49.667 --> 00:11:51.417
Miss Meme, wake up!

00:11:51.417 --> 00:11:54.417
Oh, are we better off under
the circumstances with you asleep?

00:11:54.417 --> 00:11:57.083
Miss Meme, get up, but stay asleep!

00:12:04.083 --> 00:12:07.292
Geez, you newbies are noisy.

00:12:09.333 --> 00:12:10.708
If you're gonna be DWMA students,

00:12:10.708 --> 00:12:14.708
you have to live in peace with the
housemaster, even if she is psycho.

00:12:14.708 --> 00:12:17.167
This is crazy.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.458
Good morn--

00:12:33.708 --> 00:12:38.625
What are you two up to
while I'm asleep? How indecent!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:14:00.458
Thank you so much for last night.
Thanks to you, I made it through.

00:14:00.458 --> 00:14:01.958
Could I ask what your name is?

00:14:01.958 --> 00:14:02.958
Money.

00:14:02.958 --> 00:14:04.125
Huh?

00:14:04.125 --> 00:14:07.458
If you made it through thanks
to me, that means money, right?

00:14:08.792 --> 00:14:13.042
I'm saying, hand over your
whole week's worth of allowance.

00:14:14.958 --> 00:14:16.042
Hurry it up.

00:14:16.042 --> 00:14:17.125
Okay...

00:14:17.125 --> 00:14:20.542
Kim Diehl! The witch of the girls' dorm!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.458
Mm-hmm, I'll leave you enough to eat today.

00:14:27.458 --> 00:14:29.333
Uh, thanks.

00:14:29.333 --> 00:14:33.208
That's just the way<i> those </i>kinds of people talk!

00:14:33.208 --> 00:14:35.000
Okay, see you later.

00:14:38.917 --> 00:14:42.000
Ugh, I want to go home.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.292
Back to my house, where Pochi is waiting for me.

00:14:44.292 --> 00:14:49.417
I'll have to borrow a little from
both Miss Meme and Miss Anya.

00:14:49.417 --> 00:14:52.000
It's good to have friends.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.000
Huh? What's this?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.042
Ah, Miss Tsugumi! That's Josephine.

00:14:57.042 --> 00:14:59.833
Josephine? Huh?!

00:14:59.833 --> 00:15:02.458
I bought these in town this morning!

00:15:02.458 --> 00:15:04.083
All of those?

00:15:04.083 --> 00:15:06.875
Then, by any chance, is your allowance...

00:15:06.875 --> 00:15:11.750
Miss Tsugumi, have you
seen my allowance anywhere?

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.750
It looks like I forgot where I put it.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:19.167
Well, it's not all that much money.
Don't worry about it.

00:15:19.167 --> 00:15:21.500
If you say so, Miss Anya.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:22.583
You pop the top on these.

00:15:22.583 --> 00:15:24.958
--Huh?
--Pop! Pop!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.750
Huh? Miss Anya, where is your brooch?

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:36.625
Eh? Oh, when I went shopping
this morning, I lost it somewhere.

00:15:36.625 --> 00:15:40.083
It was such a pretty brooch, too.
That's too bad.

00:15:40.083 --> 00:15:44.333
It's okay. I'm a DWMA student now.

00:15:44.333 --> 00:15:49.292
Besides, I have Josephine, now!

00:15:49.292 --> 00:15:51.250
Josephine...

00:15:55.292 --> 00:15:57.708
Excuse me, <i>soba </i>noodles, please.

00:15:57.708 --> 00:15:59.292
Three <i>soba </i>noodles, right?

00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:01.875
No, just one!

00:16:05.333 --> 00:16:07.625
--Thank you for this meal.
--Thank you for this meal.

00:16:07.625 --> 00:16:11.292
It's kind of like consommé soup
with pasta added, huh?

00:16:13.583 --> 00:16:15.958
Not very much, is there?

00:16:21.125 --> 00:16:24.958
We have to somehow make it
through until next week's allowance.

00:16:25.083 --> 00:16:26.500
"Job Placement Magazine"

00:16:26.833 --> 00:16:28.292
Part-time work?

00:16:28.292 --> 00:16:29.625
We have no choice.

00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:31.250
You're right.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.333
They have to pay by the day, so...

00:16:33.333 --> 00:16:34.458
A part-time job...

00:16:34.458 --> 00:16:36.583
Ah, this pays a great wage.

00:16:36.583 --> 00:16:40.958
I'm not sure about manual labor. We're girls.

00:16:42.417 --> 00:16:44.458
Miss Anya...

00:16:44.458 --> 00:16:46.458
Is there anything you'd like?

00:16:46.458 --> 00:16:49.917
Any labor is out of the question for me.

00:16:49.917 --> 00:16:53.375
But since you insist,
Miss Tsugumi, I will just accompany you.

00:16:53.375 --> 00:16:56.792
I-I don't have any interest in
cute uniforms, you understand.

00:16:56.792 --> 00:16:59.042
Oh, uniforms?

00:16:59.042 --> 00:17:01.667
How about this one? Cafe waitressing.

00:17:01.667 --> 00:17:04.458
Uniforms provided, first-timers welcome.

00:17:04.458 --> 00:17:08.125
"This is a popular job for girls," it says!

00:17:08.125 --> 00:17:09.792
Deathbucks Caffe?

00:17:09.792 --> 00:17:13.333
There is a job application from the princess.

00:17:13.333 --> 00:17:17.333
There's no need for us to work
there if we're just guarding them.

00:17:17.333 --> 00:17:22.083
Well then, shall we go there,
every day, to drink coffee?

00:17:22.083 --> 00:17:24.667
You're enjoying this, aren't you?

00:17:30.667 --> 00:17:33.208
Why do I have to get a job?

00:17:33.208 --> 00:17:36.542
Miss Anya, have you forgotten the reason, too?

00:17:36.542 --> 00:17:41.375
No... Huh? You've forgotten
the reason for this job?

00:17:41.375 --> 00:17:44.833
The map says it's around here.

00:17:44.833 --> 00:17:46.167
Is this it?

00:17:46.167 --> 00:17:48.583
Wow, it's so fashionable.

00:17:51.042 --> 00:17:52.792
Excuse us!

00:17:52.792 --> 00:17:56.167
We're the ones who are
here to work for the week.

00:17:56.167 --> 00:18:00.125
Yes, yes, I heard. All five of you, right?

00:18:00.125 --> 00:18:01.333
Five?

00:18:01.333 --> 00:18:02.458
Hey.

00:18:02.458 --> 00:18:03.583
Hello.

00:18:03.583 --> 00:18:06.375
Oh, you're the ones in our class,
from the entrance ceremony.

00:18:06.375 --> 00:18:08.083
I'm Clay, a weapon.

00:18:08.083 --> 00:18:10.583
Akane, meister.

00:18:10.583 --> 00:18:14.042
Are you both working because
you ran out of allowance money?

00:18:14.042 --> 00:18:16.958
He used it all up at the game center.

00:18:16.958 --> 00:18:18.083
Hey!

00:18:18.083 --> 00:18:20.375
It runs out surprisingly fast, huh?

00:18:23.917 --> 00:18:27.208
Working with boys makes me
kind of nervous, you know?

00:18:27.208 --> 00:18:29.125
I know.

00:18:29.125 --> 00:18:32.042
You think those two are high-school age?

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:37.042
Miss Meme, when you wear
that uniform, your bust is awfully...

00:18:37.042 --> 00:18:39.875
It is a bit tight, huh?

00:18:39.875 --> 00:18:41.625
Nice and buxom.

00:18:42.875 --> 00:18:46.250
Sure enough, you change into
a uniform, and it motivates you.

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.875
Ha-ha, you're so simple.

00:18:48.875 --> 00:18:51.625
Don't you both look good in those.

00:18:53.417 --> 00:18:56.792
Come on, Miss Anya, you too.
What are you waiting for?

00:18:56.792 --> 00:19:00.875
Just a minute, Miss Tsugumi.
I can't wear a skirt as short as this.

00:19:00.875 --> 00:19:02.667
You'll be fine.

00:19:04.667 --> 00:19:07.625
It's not too immodest?

00:19:07.625 --> 00:19:12.000
You have such slender,
fair, pretty legs, don't you?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.458
You perv.

00:19:14.917 --> 00:19:16.750
How precious.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:20.250
I just burned that into my memory.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.292
Well, shall we get started?

00:19:23.375 --> 00:19:26.000
Most of the customers to our shop
know that the people working here

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:28.875
are students at DWMA when they come in,

00:19:28.875 --> 00:19:31.875
so don't take things to be
too difficult, and work hard.

00:19:31.875 --> 00:19:33.500
Okay, as you please.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.083
Right!

00:19:38.958 --> 00:19:40.792
Welcome!

00:19:40.792 --> 00:19:42.125
Are you new here?

00:19:42.125 --> 00:19:43.875
Uh, yes.

00:19:43.875 --> 00:19:45.458
Good luck.

00:19:46.167 --> 00:19:48.458
Right. Thank you very much.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:50.833
Are you okay?

00:19:50.833 --> 00:19:53.833
P-Please don't talk to me!

00:19:54.583 --> 00:19:58.667
A ham sandwich, bacon and eggs,
and hot and iced coffee.

00:19:58.667 --> 00:20:00.542
Add some French fries to that.

00:20:00.542 --> 00:20:02.417
Ham... eggs...

00:20:02.417 --> 00:20:04.208
Sandwich!

00:20:04.208 --> 00:20:06.667
Would you mind starting over from the beginning?

00:20:06.667 --> 00:20:08.708
This is the third time, you know.

00:20:08.708 --> 00:20:11.250
Are those two all right?

00:20:13.167 --> 00:20:16.625
Thank you for waiting.
Here is your iced lemon tea.

00:20:16.625 --> 00:20:18.792
Please, take your time.

00:20:18.792 --> 00:20:21.583
Master, two iced coffees, please.

00:20:21.583 --> 00:20:23.417
Coming up.

00:20:23.417 --> 00:20:25.667
Ah, welcome!

00:20:25.667 --> 00:20:27.625
She's sure into this, huh?

00:20:27.625 --> 00:20:30.042
Could Miss Anya actually be nice?

00:20:30.042 --> 00:20:32.750
She's easy to figure out, isn't she?

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.208
That's something else that makes her cute.

00:20:35.208 --> 00:20:37.042
The toast set is ready.

00:20:37.042 --> 00:20:38.250
Right!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.083
Let's do our best, as well!

00:20:40.083 --> 00:20:41.208
Right.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:46.458
A hot coffee and a Mont Blanc set, right?

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:52.375
Thank you for waiting.
Your café au lait and raspberry juice.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:56.417
Here is 20 cents change. Please check it.

00:20:57.667 --> 00:21:02.208
Thank you very much.
We'll be waiting for you to visit again.

00:21:07.292 --> 00:21:11.500
Everyone, I bought something
called <i>taiyaki </i>with today's pay.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.250
Not that I was particularly interested in it.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.458
Would you like some?

00:21:15.458 --> 00:21:17.917
There you go, splurging again.

00:21:17.917 --> 00:21:22.667
Wow, these are fresh, huh? Don't mind if I do.

00:21:25.792 --> 00:21:27.583
Yum!

00:21:27.583 --> 00:21:30.083
Mm-hmm, Miss Tsugumi...

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.875
We also bought something
with our pay from today's work.

00:21:35.208 --> 00:21:37.583
To commemorate our first job.

00:21:37.583 --> 00:21:41.208
We thought you should
have something too, Miss Anya.

00:21:41.208 --> 00:21:44.917
It may not take the place
of the brooch you lost, but...

00:21:51.417 --> 00:21:53.833
If you like it...

00:21:53.833 --> 00:21:57.833
I guess it would be a shame not
to wear it, so what choice is there?

00:22:07.333 --> 00:22:10.000
Oh, yeah! I have a favor to ask you two.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:11.833
--Hmm?
--What is it?

00:22:11.833 --> 00:22:17.125
You don't always have to
call me "Miss." Just "Tsugumi."

00:22:17.125 --> 00:22:20.167
Huh? But it will be hard to
stop calling you that so suddenly.

00:22:20.167 --> 00:22:22.875
That's okay, just call me that.

00:22:22.875 --> 00:22:25.292
Yeah, but leaving off the "Miss" is so...

00:22:25.292 --> 00:22:27.792
Oh, come on!

00:22:27.792 --> 00:22:29.292
You, too, Miss Anya.

00:22:30.792 --> 00:22:32.500
Tsu--

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:33.750
Mm-hmm!

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:39.292
Tsu-- Tsugu-- gu--

00:22:39.292 --> 00:22:40.583
...<i>gumin</i>.

00:22:40.583 --> 00:22:41.208
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:22:41.208 --> 00:22:42.292
"<i>Gumin</i>" [ignorant rabble]

00:22:42.292 --> 00:22:43.875
"People who are stupid."

00:22:45.292 --> 00:22:47.042
"<i>Gumin</i>"?

00:22:47.417 --> 00:22:51.583
<i>With a big wave and a "See you,"</i>

00:22:51.583 --> 00:22:58.333
<i>let's meet in the new day</i>

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:19.417
<i>Our shadows stretch along the pavement</i>

00:23:19.417 --> 00:23:23.375
<i>coming together, then apart, then together</i>

00:23:23.375 --> 00:23:31.750
<i>What do I say when the road home ends?</i>

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:35.875
<i>You are not alone. Nope, right nearby,</i>

00:23:35.875 --> 00:23:40.042
<i>there are eyes looking back at you</i>

00:23:40.042 --> 00:23:44.167
<i>And just like a miracle,</i>

00:23:44.167 --> 00:23:47.917
<i>they can turn even failures into laughter</i>

00:23:47.917 --> 00:23:52.042
<i>Thank you for a fun day</i>

00:23:52.042 --> 00:23:56.167
<i>Let's do it again tomorrow</i>

00:23:56.167 --> 00:24:00.458
<i>We'll open a brand-new door</i>

00:24:00.458 --> 00:24:04.500
<i>chasing after dreams and love</i>

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:09.833
<i>and those nameless feelings, too</i>

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:20.083
The world of the commoners is cheerful and fun!

00:24:20.083 --> 00:24:22.708
However, there is a peril beyond imagination!

00:24:22.708 --> 00:24:24.292
Now is the time for my royal karate to--

00:24:24.292 --> 00:24:25.417
Ah! You dastardly fiend!

00:24:25.417 --> 00:24:27.333
It's Miss Tsugumi's treat!

00:24:27.333 --> 00:24:28.833
Let's have a party!

00:24:28.833 --> 00:24:32.192
"Next time: The Witch of the Girls' Dorm!"
Please don't get so cozy!
